{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0593_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ea5edfb6de84fd3b4cf01f50a1b60f400db5006068113c1810ef49f20f58c9f7", "ja": "（コスプレグラビアの撮影で北海道に来た。ジュリアは\n地元のスポーツチームの応援をすることになった）", "zh": "（因为拍摄角色扮演写真来到了北海道。茱莉亚要为当地的体育队伍加油。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0593_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "0e54e45dae926e5d1ee1212fc52aefe0a83d1602b2047757afe8a4e67e0fe9cc", "ja": "な、なあ……本当にこの衣装のまま、応援するのか？\nそもそもグラビア用の衣装だろ？", "zh": "喂、喂……真的要穿着这身衣服去加油吗？\n说到底，这不是拍写真用的服装吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0593_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a7782dfbe576ef292b4cb00b1767f37a33ecaeff818c6e9f5d8f614d0cf52dc7", "ja": "ああ。このオファーと撮影の時期が偶然重なってな。\n出版社側もチーム側もすごくノリ気で……。", "zh": "是啊。这个委托正好和拍摄时间撞在了一起。\n出版社和团队那边也都特别积极……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0593_1003_p", "source_sha256": "590dca6c1f53d6586684c3858c9500c63c3d7ac2ce348b21c4a7ecf70dc0d101", "ja": "ぜひ、この衣装でって話になったんだ。\nそれに話題作りにも、もってこいだろ？", "zh": "最后决定一定要穿这套服装。\n而且拿来制造话题也再合适不过了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0593_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "0cfe155781bf03e8414f989957599d5fb2a6e49a04f631b27e01e57d8793195e", "ja": "そりゃ、色々と大人の事情があるのはわかったよ。\n……なんで、あたしの時に限って。", "zh": "我明白，确实有各种各样的大人原因。\n……为什么偏偏轮到我的时候。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0593_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "12beb1d989043b52690f433539e89c616c8a890df242a6c8de04ce2d51228d9c", "ja": "この衣装を着たアイドルなら、他にもいるじゃないか？\nシズとか、それこそ……。", "zh": "穿这套服装的偶像，不是还有别人吗？\n比如静，或者……那什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0593_1006_p", "source_sha256": "15f3feb7e6e7ba6fd044f7542da66a2cb4980603601e5ae30b6e02d698e71554", "ja": "そう言いつつも。ひなたに北海道のことを\n聞いてきたんだろう？　やる気十分じゃないか！", "zh": "嘴上这么说着，你不是还向日向打听了北海道的事吗？干劲十足嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0593_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "75fc2f94eb2ad54b4d345909ca7b855829c251a2bc827ad08490abab28be10f7", "ja": "ど、どうしてそれを！？　……引き受けた仕事だし。\nしっかりやらなきゃ、気がすまないっていうか……。", "zh": "为、为什么会知道！？……毕竟是我接下的工作。要是不认真做好，总觉得心里过意不去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0593_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "1df55adf18f9905ed3a3a99f08d362791c41781726e8969c760fc8382851c3e0", "ja": "でも、ヒナのアドバイスがなかったら、\nちょっと大変だったかもしれないな……。", "zh": "不过，要是没有小雏的建议，可能还真会有点辛苦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0593_1009_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0593_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "429f72f0d1a8132e53c7d5fbc7cbbd3e39b644eaf76be3ef181aa6bb5259d509", "ja": "こっちに来るのに、着るものを少し増やしたんだよ。\n肌寒いかもって聞いたからさ。", "zh": "听说这边可能有点凉，所以我特意多带了几件衣服过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0593_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "721a8d8e0e58b99ba45abf6e3545966366fe32eee08f56ff08017c28e9d0f801", "ja": "風邪なんて引いたら、アイドル失格だしな。\nだから、ヒナと話して正解だったなって。", "zh": "要是感冒了，可就不配当偶像了。所以，和日向聊过真是正确的选择啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0593_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c0b7b6f57ad8d511a6a596515beda9f5900a69f7f04c355b4189e04be24676f8", "ja": "そうか。やはり地元のことは、\nその土地の人に聞くのが一番だな！", "zh": "这样啊。果然，关于当地的事，还是问当地人最靠谱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0593_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "6e396db3f610c856af8121fce07bcd2ec174006d503c77f25ec35605cd8f0fc1", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。ヒナの顔に泥を塗らないためにも、\n今日は良い仕事をしないと。", "zh": "啊，是啊。为了不给小雏丢脸，今天可得好好干一场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0593_1014_p", "source_sha256": "9c2d80263fea55fd7dab84a572d452c77316d4285a4bbc3e7bf10e96e45b0ffd", "ja": "はは。期待してるよ、ジュリア！", "zh": "哈哈，我很期待哦，茱莉亚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0593_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "01a00a335531b97b5062ecc3139c9b3cce02af5036099e5ceddc071bbf196eb2", "ja": "はいはい、分かってるよ。チームの応援も、\nグラビアの撮影もバッチリこなしてやる！", "zh": "好啦好啦，我知道了。无论是给团队加油，还是拍摄写真，我都会完美完成！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0593_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "19163076034e58012fc3a75b8a3f7db76d9e2c26027757ac4a041dd3f0828e2c", "ja": "その代わり！　帰りに北海道の美味いグルメを\n堪能させてもらうからな、{$P$}！", "zh": "不过说好了！回去的时候得让我好好享受北海道的美食，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
